Licences and terms of the files in this directory (net/)
=========================================================

The files here are derived from the sources listed in SOURCES.md. Each keeps the terms of its source:

- ip2asn/*: derived from iptoasn.com (https://iptoasn.com/), public domain (ODC PDDL v1.0).
- asn/*: combines
  - ipverse/as-metadata (https://github.com/ipverse/as-metadata), CC0 1.0;
  - NRO / RIR delegated statistics (public registry statistics);
  - Linnaeus AS classification (https://github.com/NU-AquaLab/linnaeus), MIT License (notice "linnaeus" below);
  - X4BNet lists_vpn ASN lists (https://github.com/X4BNet/lists_vpn), MIT License as stated in the project's
    README; the repository has no LICENSE file, so the README's licence section is quoted (notice "x4b" below);
  - bgp.tools class and tags (https://bgp.tools/) and Stanford ASdb (https://asdb.stanford.edu/): no licence is
    published; included in this prototype pending the owners' permission. ASdb citation: Ziv et al., IMC 2021.
- ranges/*: ranges published by their operators for public or firewall use (Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Oracle,
  GitHub, Cloudflare, Fastly, DigitalOcean, Linode/Akamai, Vultr, Zscaler, Apple, SpaceX Starlink) and VPN
  operators' public server lists (Mullvad, IVPN, NordVPN, Private Internet Access; only the address → operator
  mapping). Each range carries the date of its list; the operators' lists remain theirs.
- exits/*: single addresses from the Tor Project's exit list and relay data (CC0 1.0).
- asn-domain/*: network website domains derived from IPLocate.io's free IP to ASN database
  (https://www.iplocate.io/, https://github.com/iplocate/ip-address-databases), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). These derived files are likewise licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
  Changes: reduced to one domain per network number and split into files by network-number range.
  Credit "IPLocate.io" with a link to https://www.iplocate.io/ wherever a domain is shown.
- rdap-bootstrap.json: IANA RDAP bootstrap registries (public).

